    <string name="manual_roulette_title">How does the 24-Hour Roulette Work?</string>
    <string name="manual_roulette_body">1. Transport Switches (Top Bar): Combine ✈️ Flights, 🚆 Trains, and ⛴️ Ferries freely. Selecting a single mode updates the button icon; combining two or more shows the dynamic 🍀 clover.\n2. Filters &amp; Departure Window: Expand Roulette Settings to choose One-Way or Round-Trip (12h–120h), 1–4 passengers, departure window (24h Today, 48h Tomorrow, 72h Weekend), and Budget Guardian (Free Mode or exact numeric/slider cap).\n3. Quick Strategy Chips: Re-rank results anytime by Best Value (km/€), Cheapest, Furthest Distance, Extreme Roulette, or Earliest Departure.\n4. Instant Spin &amp; Search: Tapping Spin Roulette spins the loaded Top 20 immediately without extra reloads; use ↻ Refresh to fetch fresh fares and the search bar to filter the list by city, hub, or mode.</string>
    <string name="manual_modes_title">Real Mode, Custom APIs &amp; Demo</string>
    <string name="manual_modes_body">🟢 Real Mode: Searches live flights, trains, and ferries via public aggregators (Google Flights, Trainline, Open-HAFAS, Ferryhopper), your free Amadeus / Kiwi / TravelPayouts / Navitia keys, or any Custom JSON API configured in Settings.\n\n🧙 API Wizard: Opens from the ⋮ menu or Settings to guide your setup step by step.\n✨ AI Itinerary (Optional): With a Gemini key in Real Mode, generate express destination plans from the Winning Card.\n\n⚪ Demo Mode: Test every wheel animation, filter, and alert safely with simulated sample routes and zero network/API usage. Switch anytime from the top-bar badge or Settings.</string>
    <string name="manual_favorites_title">⭐ 24h Favorites &amp; ❤️ Wishlist</string>
    <string name="manual_favorites_body">Two complementary tools you can combine on any card:\n\n• ⭐ Star (24h Favorite): Bookmark a specific live departure for ~24h (open ⭐ on the top bar; departed trips clean up automatically).\n• ❤️ Heart (Latent Wishlist): Track up to 3 dream destinations continuously (open ❤️ on the top bar). When an offer beats your budget or tolerance near historical lows, you get a vibration &amp; push alert.</string>
    <string name="manual_radar_title">Deal Alert Radar &amp; Live Preview</string>
    <string name="manual_radar_body">Open the ⋮ menu (top-right) and tap 🔔 Price Alert Radar:\n\n1. Choose one of 3 radar rules: 💰 Lowest Price, 💎 Best km × price ratio, or ⚡ Historical Low (30d/12m or local SQLite record).\n2. Target any destination, all ❤️ Wishlist cities, or a specific saved hub.\n3. Check the Live Preview card right inside the dialog to verify how many loaded trips match before saving.\n4. Background Sync: The radar respects your active top-bar transport switches even while closed. Use \'Deals Only\' in the feed to isolate bargains.</string>
    <string name="manual_luggage_title">24-Hour Express Cabin Luggage</string>
    <string name="manual_luggage_body">To fly or ride without extra baggage fees:\n\n1. Pack a personal under-seat backpack (40×20×25 cm).\n2. Keep liquids under 100ml inside a clear zip pouch.\n3. Open \'🎒 Express Luggage\' from the ⋮ menu or directly on the Winning Card for a weather-aware interactive checklist.</string>
    <string name="manual_chain_title">Historical Bar, Chaining &amp; QR Share</string>
    <string name="manual_chain_body">• 📊 Historical Comparison: The Winning Card plots today\'s fare against the lowest observed historical price and percentage difference.\n• 🔗 Chain Trip: On One-Way picks, tap \'Chain\' to turn your destination into the new origin for the next surprise leg.\n• 📱 Share QR / Calendar: Generate an instant scannable QR invite for friends or export departure details straight to your Calendar.</string>
    <string name="manual_appearance_title">Design, Colorblind Mode &amp; Privacy</string>
    <string name="manual_appearance_body">Open ⚙️ Settings from the ⋮ menu to personalize the app:\n\n• 🎨 Theme &amp; Colorblind Mode: Switch between System, ☀️ Light, 🌙 Dark, or 👁️ Colorblind-safe (Okabe-Ito palette across wheel, badges, confetti &amp; price bar).\n• 💱 Currency &amp; Radius: Display fares in EUR, USD, or GBP and adjust nearby hub detection (50–250 km).\n• 📱 Adaptive Layout: Tablets and wide screens show controls and results side by side.\n• 🔒 Privacy &amp; Permissions: Keys stay encrypted locally on-device, GPS/Notification permissions are managed cleanly, and one tap wipes all stored keys.</string>
